{"page":309,"width":1770,"height":2581,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"8.6 교착 상태 회피","words":[{"text":"8.6","x":1204,"y":142,"width":55,"height":22},{"text":"교착","x":1275,"y":141,"width":47,"height":25},{"text":"상태","x":1330,"y":141,"width":45,"height":26},{"text":"회피","x":1385,"y":140,"width":45,"height":26}]},{"text":"그림 8.9 교착 상태 회피를 위한 자원 할당 그래프","words":[{"text":"그림","x":661,"y":701,"width":49,"height":28},{"text":"8.9","x":720,"y":703,"width":39,"height":23},{"text":"교착","x":788,"y":702,"width":50,"height":28},{"text":"상태","x":845,"y":702,"width":47,"height":29},{"text":"회피를","x":903,"y":702,"width":71,"height":28},{"text":"위한","x":983,"y":702,"width":48,"height":28},{"text":"자원","x":1039,"y":701,"width":47,"height":29},{"text":"할당","x":1096,"y":701,"width":48,"height":29},{"text":"그래프","x":1152,"y":702,"width":74,"height":28}]},{"text":"367","words":[{"text":"367","x":1503,"y":134,"width":58,"height":28}]},{"text":"로 지가 자원 치를 방출할 때, 할당 간선 R - 뙤는 예약 간선 지 - 시로 다시 변환된다.","words":[{"text":"로","x":314,"y":815,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"지가","x":361,"y":813,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"자원","x":437,"y":813,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"치를","x":514,"y":814,"width":65,"height":44},{"text":"방출할","x":591,"y":813,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"때,","x":698,"y":813,"width":37,"height":36},{"text":"할당","x":747,"y":813,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"간선","x":819,"y":813,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"R","x":889,"y":816,"width":22,"height":28},{"text":"-","x":929,"y":826,"width":32,"height":10},{"text":"뙤는","x":971,"y":816,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"예약","x":1039,"y":813,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"간선","x":1109,"y":813,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"지","x":1180,"y":816,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"-","x":1216,"y":826,"width":32,"height":9},{"text":"시로","x":1257,"y":816,"width":64,"height":42},{"text":"다시","x":1333,"y":813,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"변환된다.","x":1409,"y":813,"width":136,"height":35}]},{"text":"우리는 시스템에서 자원이 반드시 예약되어야 함에 유의해야 한다. 즉, 스레드 지가","words":[{"text":"우리는","x":378,"y":873,"width":102,"height":35},{"text":"시스템에서","x":495,"y":873,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"자원이","x":670,"y":872,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"반드시","x":776,"y":873,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"예약되어야","x":882,"y":873,"width":152,"height":36},{"text":"함에","x":1046,"y":873,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"유의해야","x":1118,"y":872,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":1253,"y":872,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"즉,","x":1336,"y":874,"width":41,"height":34},{"text":"스레드","x":1392,"y":873,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"지가","x":1504,"y":873,"width":64,"height":38}]},{"text":"실행되기 전에, 스레드의 모든 예약 간선이 자원 할당 그래프에 표시되어야 한다. 스레드","words":[{"text":"실행되기","x":315,"y":931,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"전에,","x":464,"y":932,"width":73,"height":36},{"text":"스레드의","x":550,"y":932,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"모든","x":689,"y":933,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"예약","x":765,"y":932,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"간선이","x":837,"y":932,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"자원","x":939,"y":933,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"할당","x":1011,"y":933,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"그래프에","x":1082,"y":932,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"표시되어야","x":1214,"y":931,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":1381,"y":932,"width":72,"height":35},{"text":"스레드","x":1467,"y":933,"width":100,"height":35}]},{"text":"지와 연관된 모든 간선들이 예약 간선일 때만 예약 간선 - 시를 그래프에 추가하도록","words":[{"text":"지와","x":314,"y":991,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"연관된","x":394,"y":992,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":504,"y":993,"width":66,"height":32},{"text":"간선들이","x":582,"y":991,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"예약","x":723,"y":991,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"간선일","x":795,"y":992,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"때만","x":900,"y":992,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"예약","x":972,"y":992,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"간선","x":1043,"y":992,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"-","x":1150,"y":1004,"width":33,"height":10},{"text":"시를","x":1192,"y":992,"width":62,"height":44},{"text":"그래프에","x":1265,"y":991,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"추가하도록","x":1402,"y":991,"width":166,"height":35}]},{"text":"허용함으로써 우리는 앞의 조건을 완화할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"허용함으로써","x":315,"y":1050,"width":198,"height":36},{"text":"우리는","x":528,"y":1050,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"앞의","x":639,"y":1050,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"조건을","x":712,"y":1051,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"완화할","x":817,"y":1051,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":921,"y":1052,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":965,"y":1051,"width":65,"height":36}]},{"text":"스레드 지가 자원 R를 요청한다고 가정하자. 요청 간선 지 - 시를 할당 간선 R","words":[{"text":"스레드","x":377,"y":1110,"width":102,"height":35},{"text":"지가","x":493,"y":1110,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"자원","x":568,"y":1109,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"R를","x":645,"y":1111,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"요청한다고","x":721,"y":1110,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"가정하자.","x":890,"y":1111,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"요청","x":1034,"y":1110,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"간선","x":1106,"y":1110,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"지","x":1179,"y":1113,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"-","x":1216,"y":1123,"width":34,"height":10},{"text":"시를","x":1260,"y":1112,"width":63,"height":43},{"text":"할당","x":1335,"y":1111,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"간선","x":1411,"y":1110,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"R","x":1488,"y":1113,"width":25,"height":28}]},{"text":"기로 변환해도 자원 할당 그래프에 사이클을 형성하지 않을 때만 요청을 허용할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"기로","x":314,"y":1172,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"변환해도","x":392,"y":1169,"width":133,"height":36},{"text":"자원","x":537,"y":1169,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"할당","x":613,"y":1169,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"그래프에","x":689,"y":1169,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"사이클을","x":827,"y":1170,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"형성하지","x":963,"y":1170,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"않을","x":1096,"y":1170,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"때만","x":1168,"y":1170,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"요청을","x":1238,"y":1170,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"허용할","x":1344,"y":1170,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1449,"y":1169,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1497,"y":1169,"width":71,"height":36}]},{"text":"우리가 사이클 탐지(cycle detection) 알고리즘을 이용해 안전성을 검사한다는 사실에","words":[{"text":"우리가","x":313,"y":1227,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"사이클","x":430,"y":1228,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"탐지(cycle","x":545,"y":1229,"width":158,"height":40},{"text":"detection)","x":718,"y":1232,"width":158,"height":35},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":892,"y":1229,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"이용해","x":1060,"y":1229,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"안전성을","x":1163,"y":1229,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"검사한다는","x":1299,"y":1229,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"사실에","x":1470,"y":1229,"width":97,"height":36}]},{"text":"유의하라. 이 그래프에서 사이클을 탐지하는 알고리즘은 n2 자수의 연산이 필요하다(여","words":[{"text":"유의하라.","x":314,"y":1287,"width":142,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":475,"y":1288,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"그래프에서","x":520,"y":1288,"width":158,"height":35},{"text":"사이클을","x":696,"y":1288,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"탐지하는","x":836,"y":1289,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":974,"y":1289,"width":154,"height":35},{"text":"n2","x":1138,"y":1285,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"자수의","x":1183,"y":1288,"width":88,"height":37},{"text":"연산이","x":1290,"y":1289,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"필요하다(여","x":1395,"y":1289,"width":171,"height":39}]},{"text":"기서 n은 시스템에 있는 스레드의 수이다).","words":[{"text":"기서","x":315,"y":1346,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"n은","x":393,"y":1347,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"시스템에","x":461,"y":1347,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"있는","x":607,"y":1347,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"스레드의","x":680,"y":1348,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"수이다).","x":818,"y":1348,"width":112,"height":39}]},{"text":"만약 사이클이 없다면 자원을 할당해도 시스템은 안전 상태가 된다. 사이클이 발견","words":[{"text":"만약","x":378,"y":1405,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"사이클이","x":458,"y":1406,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"없다면","x":609,"y":1407,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"자원을","x":717,"y":1407,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"할당해도","x":825,"y":1408,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"시스템은","x":963,"y":1408,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"안전","x":1100,"y":1408,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"상태가","x":1172,"y":1409,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"된다.","x":1278,"y":1408,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"사이클이","x":1361,"y":1409,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"발견","x":1504,"y":1409,"width":64,"height":35}]},{"text":"되면, 할당은 시스템을 불안전 상태로 만들 것이다. 그러므로 스레드 지는 자신의 요청이","words":[{"text":"되면,","x":315,"y":1464,"width":74,"height":36},{"text":"할당은","x":403,"y":1465,"width":103,"height":35},{"text":"시스템을","x":518,"y":1466,"width":130,"height":34},{"text":"불안전","x":659,"y":1466,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"상태로","x":767,"y":1467,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"만들","x":873,"y":1468,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"것이다.","x":948,"y":1468,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"그러므로","x":1059,"y":1467,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"스레드","x":1192,"y":1468,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"지는","x":1295,"y":1470,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"자신의","x":1365,"y":1468,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"요청이","x":1472,"y":1469,"width":95,"height":36}]},{"text":"충족될 때까지 반드시 대기해야 한다.","words":[{"text":"충족될","x":312,"y":1523,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"때까지","x":428,"y":1524,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"반드시","x":541,"y":1525,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"대기해야","x":650,"y":1525,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":788,"y":1527,"width":70,"height":35}]},{"text":"이 알고리즘을 설명하기 위해 그림 8.9의 자원 할당 그래프를 고려해 보자. T2가 R2","words":[{"text":"이","x":379,"y":1583,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"알고리즘을","x":425,"y":1584,"width":166,"height":34},{"text":"설명하기","x":604,"y":1584,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"위해","x":746,"y":1585,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"그림","x":820,"y":1586,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"8.9의","x":895,"y":1587,"width":72,"height":35},{"text":"자원","x":982,"y":1587,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"할당","x":1056,"y":1586,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"그래프를","x":1129,"y":1587,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"고려해","x":1262,"y":1587,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"보자.","x":1368,"y":1587,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"T2가","x":1453,"y":1588,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"R2","x":1534,"y":1593,"width":37,"height":35}]},{"text":"를 요청한다고 가정하자. R2가 현재는 가용 상태이지만, 우리는 이를 T2에 할당할 수 없","words":[{"text":"를","x":313,"y":1642,"width":35,"height":33},{"text":"요청한다고","x":360,"y":1642,"width":170,"height":36},{"text":"가정하자.","x":544,"y":1643,"width":135,"height":36},{"text":"R2가","x":693,"y":1644,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"현재는","x":777,"y":1645,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"가용","x":883,"y":1646,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"상태이지만,","x":956,"y":1646,"width":161,"height":36},{"text":"우리는","x":1129,"y":1646,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"이를","x":1235,"y":1645,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"T2에","x":1307,"y":1646,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"할당할","x":1384,"y":1646,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1492,"y":1648,"width":34,"height":34},{"text":"없","x":1541,"y":1649,"width":29,"height":34}]},{"text":"다. 왜냐하면, 할당할 경우 그래프에 사이클이 생기기 때문이다(그림 8.10). 사이클은 시","words":[{"text":"다.","x":314,"y":1700,"width":41,"height":35},{"text":"왜냐하면,","x":371,"y":1701,"width":143,"height":36},{"text":"할당할","x":528,"y":1702,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"경우","x":640,"y":1703,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"그래프에","x":715,"y":1703,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"사이클이","x":854,"y":1705,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"생기기","x":990,"y":1704,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"때문이다(그림","x":1094,"y":1704,"width":190,"height":38},{"text":"8.10).","x":1299,"y":1707,"width":82,"height":35},{"text":"사이클은","x":1396,"y":1705,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"시","x":1538,"y":1707,"width":28,"height":35}]},{"text":"스템이 불안전한 상대에 있음을 의미한다. 만일 지이 R2를 요청하고, T2가 RI을 요청하","words":[{"text":"스템이","x":314,"y":1760,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"불안전한","x":429,"y":1760,"width":136,"height":34},{"text":"상대에","x":576,"y":1761,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"있음을","x":689,"y":1762,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"의미한다.","x":796,"y":1762,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"만일","x":941,"y":1763,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"지이","x":1014,"y":1763,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"R2를","x":1088,"y":1765,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"요청하고,","x":1168,"y":1763,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"T2가","x":1312,"y":1763,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"RI을","x":1389,"y":1763,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"요청하","x":1472,"y":1765,"width":100,"height":35}]},{"text":"면 교착 상태가 발생한다.","words":[{"text":"면","x":317,"y":1818,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"교착","x":360,"y":1819,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"상태가","x":440,"y":1819,"width":102,"height":35},{"text":"발생한다.","x":553,"y":1819,"width":137,"height":36}]},{"text":"그림 8.10 불안전 상태의 자원 할당 그래프","words":[{"text":"그림","x":712,"y":2373,"width":49,"height":27},{"text":"8.10","x":771,"y":2374,"width":56,"height":24},{"text":"불안전","x":856,"y":2374,"width":73,"height":28},{"text":"상태의","x":938,"y":2374,"width":70,"height":29},{"text":"자원","x":1017,"y":2374,"width":47,"height":28},{"text":"할당","x":1073,"y":2373,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"그래프","x":1130,"y":2373,"width":73,"height":28}]}]}